Edit 'CAP_POL.DEV';
DESCRIPTION '<b>Capacitor Polarized</b>\nThese are standard SMD and PTH capacitors. Normally 10uF, 47uF, and 100uF in electrolytic and tantalum varieties. Always verify the external diameter of the through hole cap, it varies with capacity, voltage, and manufacturer. The EIA devices should be standard.';
PREFIX 'C';
VALUE On;
CHANGE Addlevel  Next;
CHANGE Swaplevel 0;
ADD 'CAP_POL' 'G$1' (0.000000 0.000000);
PACKAGE 'EIA3216' 1206;
CONNECT ALL 'G$1.+' 'A';
CONNECT ALL 'G$1.-' 'C';
